OverTheWire Bandit: Level 8 → 9

Objective
Find the password for Level 9.
The password is stored in the file data.txt and is the only unique line.

Steps
Log in as bandit8:
ssh bandit8@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220
Sort the file and extract the unique line:
sort data.txt | uniq -u

Result
The command output displays the password for Bandit Level 9.
